                                "sense_id": "0ed5a417-cc15-3e33-a84f-5fd8f0831816",
                                "text": "Birribirai, a youth not yet admitted to a bora."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d7bf479-4f56-454e-b00a-b9ef80e025db",
                                "sense_id": "0ed5a417-cc15-3e33-a84f-5fd8f0831816",
                                "text": "By far the most important among the ceremonies practised by the aborigines of New South Wales is the Bora, at which youths are initiated to manhood..."
